    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "ZPITOLZIR\nREGIONAL\nFLIGHT SCHEDULES\nEffective November 01, 1983\nNEW YORK\nChicago\nLos Angeles *\nPhiladelphia *\n* Boston\nNew York\n-*Brussels\n*Frankfurt\nMiami\nPuerto Plata *\n** San Juan\nAguadilla/Borinquen\nCapitol is the best buy in the sky wherever we\nfly. No advance purchase, no minimum stay, no\nlower fares.\nJust Star-Spangled Service to the heart of Eu-\nrope and the Caribbean, as well as key U.S. cities\nfrom Coast to Coast. And more money to spend\nwhen you get where you're going, thanks to\nCapitol's low fare.\nCome light up the sky with us!\nSERVING THE PUBLIC FOR 37 YEARS",
